{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-i", "title": "梁惠王上", "description": "孟子見梁惠王。王曰：「叟不遠千里而來，亦將有以利吾國乎？」\n孟子對曰：「王何必曰利？亦有仁義而已矣。王曰『何以利吾國』？大夫曰『何以利吾家』？士庶人曰『何以利吾身』？上下交征利而國危矣。萬乘之國弒其君者，必千乘之家；千乘之國弒其君者，必百乘之家。萬取千焉，千取百焉，不為不多矣。苟為後義而先利，不奪不饜。未有仁而遺其親者", "occurrences": 8, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "刃", "id": "刃"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "孝悌", "id": "孝悌"}, {"form": "小", "id": "小"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "敵", "id": "敵"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "父母", "id": "父母"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "異", "id": "異"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.076139432816051, "source": "異", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 0.46095379372581763, "source": "異", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.6855773452501515, "source": "異", "target": "敵"}, {"weight": 2.4624337939359418, "source": "行", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 1.027349268646619, "source": "行", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.4624337939359418, "source": "行", "target": "父母"}, {"weight": 1.1541009742857629, "source": "行", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 0.17327172127403678, "source": "敵", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.992430164690206, "source": "敵", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.6855773452501515, "source": "敵", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 1.8746471290338227, "source": "小", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 0.5165236448806284, "source": "人", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 1.076139432816051, "source": "人", "target": "刃"}, {"weight": 0.3829922522561057, "source": "人", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.363821505267832, "source": "政", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.4624337939359418, "source": "政", "target": "刃"}, {"weight": 1.2096708254405737, "source": "政", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 1.951608170169951, "source": "政", "target": "父母"}, {"weight": 2.4624337939359418, "so